{"id":325,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Spoink keeps a pearl on top of its head. The pearl functions to amplify this Pokémon’s psychokinetic powers. It is therefore on a constant search for a bigger pearl."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Spoink bounces around on its tail. The shock of its bouncing makes its heart pump. As a result, this Pokémon cannot afford to stop bouncing—if it stops, its heart will stop."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It bounces around on its tail to keep its heart pumping. It carries a pearl from Clamperl on its head."},{"games":["X","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It bounces constantly, using its tail like a spring. The shock of bouncing keeps its heart beating."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Using its tail like a spring, it keeps its heart beating by bouncing constantly. If it stops, it dies."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It apparently dies if it stops bouncing about. It carries a pearl from CLAMPERL on its head."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A POKéMON that manipulates psychic power at will. It doesn’t stop bouncing even when it is asleep. It loves eating mushrooms that grow underground."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Thick Fat","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is protected by a layer of thick fat, which halves the damage taken from Fire- and Ice-type moves."},{"name":"Own Tempo","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon sticks to its own tempo, preventing it from becoming confused or being affected by Intimidate."},{"name":"Gluttony","hidden":true,"description":"If the Pokémon is holding a Berry to be eaten when its HP is low, it will instead eat the Berry when its HP drops to half or less."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":"mountain","color":"Black","shape":"Arms","evolution":{"id":325,"name":"Spoink","condition":null,"children":[{"id":326,"name":"Grumpig","condition":"Lv. 32","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,150],[7,93],[10,45],[14,60],[18,244],[22,109],[29,156],[29,408],[33,173],[38,473],[40,371],[44,94],[50,340]],"machine":[133,34,347,451,886,109,605,227,283,203,797,263,430,248,447,270,196,286,113,679,101,408,182,60,244,94,678,473,240,115,156,247,285,214,555,883,500,164,241,129,36,269,851,168,86,885,271,433,253,428],"egg":[133,326,248,243,493,271,18,428],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me1-62","name":"Spoink","set":"Mega Evolution","date":"2025-09-26","rarity":"Common","number":"62","artist":null,"img":"me1/62"},{"id":"sv3-90","name":"Spoink","set":"Obsidian Flames","date":"2023-08-11","rarity":"Common","number":"90","artist":"GOSSAN","img":"sv3/90"},{"id":"swsh5-55","name":"Spoink","set":"Battle Styles","date":"2021-03-19","rarity":"Common","number":"55","artist":"kawayoo","img":"swsh5/55"},{"id":"sm7-59","name":"Spoink","set":"Celestial Storm","date":"2018-08-03","rarity":"Common","number":"59","artist":"MAHOU","img":"sm7/59"},{"id":"sm4-41","name":"Spoink","set":"Crimson Invasion","date":"2017-11-03","rarity":"Common","number":"41","artist":"Sekio","img":"sm4/41"},{"id":"xy10-30","name":"Spoink","set":"Fates Collide","date":"2016-05-02","rarity":"Common","number":"30","artist":"TOKIYA","img":"xy10/30"},{"id":"xy1-49","name":"Spoink","set":"XY","date":"2014-02-05","rarity":"Common","number":"49","artist":"Atsuko Nishida","img":"xy1/49"},{"id":"bw7-59","name":"Spoink","set":"Boundaries Crossed","date":"2012-11-07","rarity":"Common","number":"59","artist":"Sumiyoshi Kizuki","img":"bw7/59"},{"id":"hgss4-77","name":"Spoink","set":"HS—Triumphant","date":"2010-11-03","rarity":"Common","number":"77","artist":"Yukiko Baba","img":"hgss4/77"},{"id":"dp6-121","name":"Spoink","set":"Legends Awakened","date":"2008-08-01","rarity":"Common","number":"121","artist":"Kouki Saitou","img":"dp6/121"},{"id":"ex14-62","name":"Spoink","set":"Crystal Guardians","date":"2006-08-01","rarity":"Common","number":"62","artist